<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40564" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕcĭdīvus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		1. recido, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>falling back</i>, i. e. trop., <i>returning</i>, <i>recurring</i> (rare, and not
			ante-Aug.; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">redivivus): febris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 3,
					4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 30, 11, 30, § 104</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">semina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mel.
					3, 6, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nummus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					6, 363</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mala,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Grat. Act. 33</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vita,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Marc. 4, 25 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			—<b>Poet.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pergama,</span>”
				<i>restored</i>, <i>rebuilt</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 4, 344</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">7, 322</span></i>; <i><span class="en">10, 58</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imitated in gens Phrygum,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the Romans</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					1, 106</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bella,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					10, 257</span></i>
			 (al. rediviva).</div>
